      "body": "跨平台 SSH & SFTP 客户端 Shell360 开源啦，项目地址：https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360\n\n## 主要功能\n\nShell360 支持 Windows / macOS / Linux / Android / iOS 等操作系统，具体功能如下：\n\n- SSH / SFTP：SSH 支持密码、公钥认证\n- 端口转发功能：支持远程、本地、动态转发模式\n- 数据导入导出：支持数据导入导出，方便多端同步\n- 应用数据加密：应用的数据支持加密存储，避免被窃取\n\n## 下载安装\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/shell360/id6502880351\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nashaofu/shell360/93abeeec519914202bd6a4501a22bb71c1559764/resources/app-store.svg\" width=\"123\" alt=\"在 App Store 上下载\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nashaofu.shell360\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/blob/master/resources/GooglePlay.png?raw=true\" width=\"140\" alt=\"在 Google Play 上下载\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/releases\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/下载%20Windows%20版本-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"下载 Windows 版本\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/releases\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/下载%20macOS%20版本-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"下载 macOS 版本\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/releases\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/下载%20Linux%20版本-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"下载 Linux 版本\" />\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/releases\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/下载%20Android%20版本-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"下载 Android 版本\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n此外也可加入[TestFlight](https://testflight.apple.com/join/teqJZCRm)或者[Google Play](https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.nashaofu.shell360)测试计划，抢先体验新功能。\n\n## 桌面端截图展示\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img width=\"45%\" src=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/blob/master/resources/screenshots/desktop/terminal.png?raw=true1\" />\n  <img width=\"45%\" src=\"https://github.com/nashaofu/shell360/blob/master/resources/screenshots/desktop/sftp.png?raw=true\" />\n</p>\n\n## 移动端截图展示\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img width=\"23%\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03b9d1df-3e01-4925-868b-f1f5cfe83f71\" />\n  <img width=\"23%\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26a66f05-df68-41b6-bb83-417df73a10fe\" />\n  <img width=\"23%\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bcb011b-eb43-4982-a4e8-3bdd575150e1\" />\n  <img width=\"23%\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c06134cd-0774-435c-a145-78374c3f660b\" />\n</p>\n\n## 招募 Google Play 测试用户\n\n由于 Google Play 需要 12 名成员参与封闭测试 14 天才能上架，所以邀请大家帮忙加入一下测试。由于封测只能通过邀请的方式，所以有愿意参与的朋友可以发送邮箱到(base64)：ZGlhb2NoZW5nQG91dGxvb2suY29t\n",
